flowchart TD
    A[Business event committed] --> B[Resolve document type and source record]
    B --> C[Validate active Shop and Employee permissions]
    C --> D[Build immutable snapshot]
    D --> E[Persist GeneratedDocument metadata and snapshot]
    E --> F[Select retained template version and layout]
    F --> G[Render PDF]
    G --> H[Preview / Download / Browser Print]
    H --> I{Reprint?}
    I -- No --> J[Complete]
    I -- Yes --> K[Append DocumentReprintEvent]
    K --> F
    G -.-> L[No financial or inventory side effect]
